#. module: spreadsheet_api_oca
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spreadsheet_api_oca.api_token_view_form
msgid ""
"Each call carries the headers X-Spreadsheet-Event, X-Spreadsheet-Token-Id "
"and X-Spreadsheet-Signature. The signature is \"sha256=\" followed by the "
"HMAC-SHA256 of the raw request body, using the SHA-256 hex digest of your "
"token as key. Redirects are not followed, and events are only sent for "
"spreadsheets the token user can read."
msgstr ""
"Elke aanroep bevat de headers X-Spreadsheet-Event, X-Spreadsheet-Token-Id en"
" X-Spreadsheet-Signature. De handtekening is \"sha256=\" gevolgd door de "
"HMAC-SHA256 van de onbewerkte request-body, met de SHA-256-hexdigest van uw "
"token als sleutel. Omleidingen worden niet gevolgd en gebeurtenissen worden "
"alleen verzonden voor spreadsheets die de tokengebruiker kan lezen."

#. module: spreadsheet_api_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:spreadsheet_api_oca.field_spreadsheet_api_webhook_event__event_type
